WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.960
=Episode 18=

01:51.561 --> 01:52.281
What's wrong?

01:52.882 --> 01:53.722
Feeling unwell?

01:54.442 --> 01:54.962
What's wrong?

01:55.681 --> 01:56.362
Fei Ting.

01:58.041 --> 01:58.921
I'm telling you.

01:59.442 --> 02:02.162
I don't care
whether you like this job or not.

02:02.561 --> 02:04.162
Fei Ni spent a lot of effort

02:04.162 --> 02:05.281
to get you this job.

02:05.561 --> 02:07.681
It's not just about you.

02:07.882 --> 02:08.962
You might just affect

02:09.082 --> 02:10.721
Fei Ni's relationship with Ms. Wang.

02:11.441 --> 02:12.962
It can't be that serious.

02:12.962 --> 02:14.082
What do you know?

02:14.482 --> 02:15.522
You need to listen to me.

02:15.522 --> 02:17.322
Don't come here anymore.

02:17.721 --> 02:19.121
Even if you loathe this job,

02:19.121 --> 02:20.522
you're staying forever

02:20.522 --> 02:21.881
in the Publicity Division,

02:21.881 --> 02:22.721
got it?

02:29.121 --> 02:29.922
Fei Ting.

02:31.161 --> 02:32.922
I don't ask much from you.

02:33.561 --> 02:35.441
I just want us to live

02:35.441 --> 02:36.522
a simple live together.

02:38.322 --> 02:40.322
Do you know how happy I was
when you got this job?

02:40.762 --> 02:42.281
Everyone said I was so lucky.

02:43.681 --> 02:44.522
When I returned home,

02:45.522 --> 02:48.322
even my sister-in-law
stopped looking down on me.

02:49.362 --> 02:50.441
But you?

02:50.962 --> 02:52.482
Instead of working hard,

02:52.482 --> 02:53.561
you're being stubborn.

02:54.121 --> 02:55.922
Can't you spare a thought for me?

02:55.922 --> 02:57.082
Why are you crying?

02:58.242 --> 02:59.161
Stop crying.

02:59.161 --> 03:00.841
People would think
I did something to you.

03:01.642 --> 03:02.441
I was wrong.

03:02.721 --> 03:06.082
I promise you,
I won't come here anymore.

03:11.922 --> 03:13.362
You better mean what you say.

03:13.762 --> 03:14.721
It's a deal.

03:19.561 --> 03:20.762
Take this.

03:20.835 --> 03:22.272
(Mixed Fruit Candies)

03:22.322 --> 03:24.362
Share it with your boss and colleagues.

03:24.561 --> 03:26.522
We didn't offer any wedding favors.

03:27.270 --> 03:28.482
They might talk bad behind you.

03:30.841 --> 03:31.721
I'm off, then.

03:32.161 --> 03:33.642
Go back and work.

03:35.522 --> 03:36.841
Take that apron off.

03:39.401 --> 03:40.202
Go to work.

03:44.922 --> 03:46.362
Did she cry or not?

03:59.922 --> 04:04.822
(Duty Room)

04:04.881 --> 04:05.482
Hello.

04:05.482 --> 04:06.642
Who are you looking for?

04:07.202 --> 04:07.802
Hello.

04:08.401 --> 04:09.922
I'm looking for Dr. Qu Hua.

04:10.362 --> 04:11.281
Dr. Qu?

04:11.401 --> 04:12.642
He's in operation.

04:12.962 --> 04:13.642
Who's on the line?

04:13.642 --> 04:15.441
Should I leave a message for him?

04:21.202 --> 04:22.762
No, thank you.

04:42.041 --> 04:43.241
(Comrade Qu Hua.)

04:44.522 --> 04:45.721
(After much thought,)

04:46.801 --> 04:48.682
(I believe it's better we divorce.)

04:51.601 --> 04:53.562
(We married for mutual benefits,)

04:55.041 --> 04:56.562
(and we've gotten what we wanted.)

04:57.721 --> 05:00.122
(There's no need to stay
in this loveless marriage.)

05:01.921 --> 05:03.041
(What do you think?)

05:03.721 --> 05:04.442
(Please reply.)

05:18.060 --> 05:22.197
(Divorce Agreement,
Initiated by: Fang Mujing)

05:22.281 --> 05:23.041
Dr. Qu.

05:24.002 --> 05:25.361
The operation hall is ready.

05:27.401 --> 05:28.401
Okay, got it.

05:36.585 --> 05:39.060
(Sender: Fang Mujing
To: Qu Hua)

05:42.085 --> 05:42.822
(Sender: Fang Mujing
To: Qu Hua)

05:44.841 --> 05:46.601
My mom invited you over for dinner.

05:46.882 --> 05:48.281
Why should I go to your home?

05:48.442 --> 05:49.281
Why?

05:49.642 --> 05:51.041
Because you're my girlfriend.

05:51.041 --> 05:51.642
Really?

05:51.921 --> 05:54.401
I thought you're just using me
as a tool to annoy Fei Ni.

05:55.281 --> 05:55.921
Ling Yi.

05:56.281 --> 05:57.682
You've got the wrong idea.

05:58.002 --> 05:59.481
I did use you to annoy Fei Ni,

05:59.481 --> 06:00.642
but you're not a tool.

06:00.682 --> 06:02.241
You're a living, breathing human.

06:07.161 --> 06:08.601
I just couldn't stand the sight

06:08.801 --> 06:10.601
of Fei Ni and Fang Muyang together.

06:10.601 --> 06:11.481
I was confused.

06:11.682 --> 06:13.801
How is Fang Muyang
better than me in any way?

06:17.202 --> 06:17.882
Ye Feng.

06:18.882 --> 06:21.002
I think you're better than Fang Muyang
in every way,

06:21.241 --> 06:24.202
but I don't understand
why you're comparing yourself to him.

06:24.562 --> 06:26.762
You think I'm better than Fang Muyang
in every way?

06:27.202 --> 06:28.002
Of course.

06:28.682 --> 06:30.161
Your education, job,

06:30.161 --> 06:31.361
your family,

06:31.361 --> 06:32.122
your looks...

06:32.322 --> 06:34.335
You're superior than him in every way.

06:34.762 --> 06:35.401
Besides,

06:35.401 --> 06:36.841
you're a great basketball player.

06:38.841 --> 06:40.801
Why didn't Fei Ni choose me, then?

06:44.180 --> 06:45.882
When I was working
in the production team,

06:46.002 --> 06:48.110
there's a saying among the locals.

06:48.682 --> 06:49.682
Fish attracts fish,

06:49.682 --> 06:50.882
shrimps attract shrimps,

06:51.682 --> 06:53.082
and turtles attract...

06:54.202 --> 06:55.161
Turtles attract what?

06:57.642 --> 06:58.660
Turtles attract tortoises.

07:01.281 --> 07:02.762
I know it's vulgar,

07:02.762 --> 07:03.882
but it makes sense.

07:04.161 --> 07:05.241
Fei Ni didn't choose you

07:05.241 --> 07:06.682
not because you're not good enough,

07:06.682 --> 07:08.601
or because you're not
as good as Fang Muyang.

07:08.801 --> 07:09.401
It's because...

07:09.401 --> 07:10.682
She likes that tortoise.

07:13.682 --> 07:14.682
Anyway,

07:15.322 --> 07:16.522
I think you shouldn't

07:16.522 --> 07:17.522
doubt yourself because of

07:17.522 --> 07:18.950
a wrong choice made by someone else,

07:19.202 --> 07:20.122
let alone...

07:23.682 --> 07:24.562
Let alone use me.

07:31.241 --> 07:32.281
Sorry, Ling Yi.

07:32.801 --> 07:34.202
I was just annoyed by Fei Ni

07:34.202 --> 07:35.241
and Fang Muyang.

07:35.562 --> 07:36.642
You're right.

07:36.962 --> 07:39.041
Fei Ni didn't choose me,
and that's her own problem.

07:39.041 --> 07:39.880
She's got poor taste.

07:39.962 --> 07:40.442
She...

07:43.481 --> 07:44.161
Anyway,

07:44.601 --> 07:45.682
I was wrong.

07:46.241 --> 07:47.962
I shouldn't have focused on Fei Ni

07:48.202 --> 07:49.682
and neglected your feelings.

07:51.562 --> 07:52.361
Ling Yi.

07:53.041 --> 07:54.082
From today onward,

07:54.841 --> 07:55.601
let's forget

07:55.601 --> 07:56.962
everything bad between us.

07:57.481 --> 07:59.442
We'll make this work, okay?

08:03.962 --> 08:05.481
We missed that movie last time.

08:06.082 --> 08:07.082
I want to watch it.

08:10.082 --> 08:10.682
Sure!

08:10.882 --> 08:12.401
Let's catch a movie

08:12.401 --> 08:13.601
and have dinner at my house!

08:18.281 --> 08:18.762
Mom!

08:19.202 --> 08:19.721
Lin Mei!

08:20.481 --> 08:22.601
The Publicity Division
is visiting workers today,

08:22.601 --> 08:24.481
and I've been asked to follow.

08:24.481 --> 08:25.962
At least stay for dinner.

08:25.962 --> 08:26.762
I'm in a rush.

08:26.882 --> 08:27.721
That boy...

08:28.122 --> 08:29.241
It's okay, Mom.

08:29.762 --> 08:30.882
Work comes first.

08:30.962 --> 08:32.481
I'll deliver his dinner later.

08:33.001 --> 08:33.721
Besides,

08:34.202 --> 08:35.841
if he's asked to follow,

08:36.042 --> 08:38.042
it means Ms. Wang favors him.

08:38.042 --> 08:38.881
It's a good thing.

08:39.881 --> 08:40.802
You're right.

08:49.402 --> 08:50.082
Eat more.

09:03.442 --> 09:04.001
Ni.

09:04.761 --> 09:06.601
Are you two dating for real?

09:07.282 --> 09:09.082
You're not lying this time, are you?

09:10.042 --> 09:10.521
Mom.

09:10.881 --> 09:12.241
If you don't believe us,

09:12.680 --> 09:13.802
we can kiss in front of you.

09:13.802 --> 09:14.442
No!

09:14.442 --> 09:15.802
I believe you.

09:18.042 --> 09:18.802
Did they kiss?

09:18.802 --> 09:19.562
I'm covering my eyes.

09:19.562 --> 09:20.442
I can't see.

09:20.442 --> 09:22.481
Can't you make a gap
between your fingers and peek?

09:26.641 --> 09:27.802
They're kissing.

09:30.922 --> 09:32.042
That's enough.

09:36.972 --> 09:41.841
(Reception Room)

09:41.841 --> 09:42.841
Hello, sir.

09:43.162 --> 09:44.150
Who are you looking for?

09:44.162 --> 09:46.442
I'm Fei Ting's wife.
He works at the Publicity Division.

09:46.442 --> 09:47.562
I brought his dinner.

09:47.682 --> 09:48.841
Publicity Department?

09:49.641 --> 09:51.361
Everyone has left.

09:52.042 --> 09:53.841
I thought they're visiting workers?

09:54.361 --> 09:56.881
Why would they visit anyone
when there's no special occasion?

09:57.080 --> 09:57.950
There's no such thing.

09:59.082 --> 10:01.042
So, did Fei Ting come back?

10:01.082 --> 10:01.881
No.

10:03.962 --> 10:04.881
Thank you, sir.

10:24.962 --> 10:25.950
Why are you still awake?

10:27.740 --> 10:29.001
How many families did you visit?

10:29.202 --> 10:30.442
Why are you back so late?

10:32.121 --> 10:33.121
How many...

10:34.001 --> 10:34.962
No, I...

10:35.241 --> 10:37.082
I had some work to finish afterwards.

10:37.361 --> 10:38.521
I went back to the factory.

10:39.121 --> 10:40.841
I brought your dinner to the factory.

10:41.601 --> 10:43.820
Why did the receptionist say
there's no such activity?

10:46.562 --> 10:48.001
What would they know?

10:48.922 --> 10:50.402
Why would we tell the Reception Room

10:50.402 --> 10:51.950
about our work
in the Publicity Division?

10:53.841 --> 10:54.442
Wait.

10:55.562 --> 10:56.521
What's that smell?

10:59.721 --> 11:00.802
Why do I smell

11:01.042 --> 11:02.361
some snow cream on you?

11:02.761 --> 11:03.562
Let me smell that.

11:08.962 --> 11:11.202
The factory's workers

11:11.361 --> 11:12.521
are using this cream,

11:12.721 --> 11:13.282
right?

11:14.042 --> 11:14.841
That's enough.

11:14.962 --> 11:15.761
I'm pooped.

11:16.042 --> 11:16.841
Go take a bath.

11:17.521 --> 11:18.162
I'll skip.

11:18.162 --> 11:18.881
No need.

11:18.962 --> 11:20.562
No, take a bath.

11:20.570 --> 11:21.740
Or else I won't let you sleep.

11:25.001 --> 11:25.641
Be gentle.

11:25.761 --> 11:26.881
Don't wake your parents up.

11:42.442 --> 11:43.162
Why do I also

11:43.162 --> 11:44.562
smell lard on his shirt?

12:08.802 --> 12:10.042
(To: Fang Mujing)
Is that from your husband?

12:10.521 --> 12:11.641
(From: Qu Hua)
What did he give you?

12:14.361 --> 12:15.922
Probably nothing nice.

12:30.922 --> 12:32.947
(Braised Beef)

12:37.322 --> 12:38.997
(Braised Beef)

13:14.682 --> 13:15.460
(It's getting cold,)

13:15.960 --> 13:17.042
(so I bought you a sweater.)

13:17.962 --> 13:19.641
(I hope it fits.)

13:20.562 --> 13:22.241
(I chose your favorite color.)

13:22.980 --> 13:24.250
(You can share the milk candies)

13:24.282 --> 13:25.322
(with your colleagues,)

13:25.601 --> 13:26.562
(except Liu Wei.)

13:27.481 --> 13:29.402
(Save the canned foods for yourself.)

13:38.761 --> 13:39.402
(Jiangnan People's Hospital)
Dr. Qu.

13:39.481 --> 13:40.442
A call for you.

13:44.121 --> 13:45.601
Hello, I'm Qu Hua.

13:46.322 --> 13:47.282
Have you been busy?

13:52.601 --> 13:53.402
Manageable.

13:54.402 --> 13:55.641
Did you receive my letter?

13:56.601 --> 13:57.442
Yes.

13:59.042 --> 14:00.162
Why didn't you reply?

14:01.241 --> 14:02.042
I did.

14:02.841 --> 14:03.841
Didn't you receive it?

14:08.562 --> 14:09.361
I did.

14:10.121 --> 14:10.682
Bye.

14:25.510 --> 14:27.597
(Braised Beef)

14:32.641 --> 14:33.322
Ding Yang.

14:34.402 --> 14:35.241
Have some candies.

14:37.641 --> 14:39.402
So many candies?

14:40.521 --> 14:41.641
I'll just take two.

14:42.361 --> 14:43.121
Take this, too.

14:45.001 --> 14:45.962
For me?

14:47.042 --> 14:47.922
Mujing.

14:48.042 --> 14:49.682
Your husband is so nice to you.

15:23.572 --> 15:27.122
(From: Qu Hua)

15:30.960 --> 15:32.322
(Male Sweater)
This looks good.

15:33.241 --> 15:34.521
It does.

15:35.641 --> 15:37.282
It looks difficult to make, though.

15:37.322 --> 15:38.241
Not at all.

15:38.402 --> 15:39.042
Hey,

15:39.042 --> 15:40.121
I can teach you.

15:40.481 --> 15:42.270
If you can't make it,
I'll make one for you.

15:42.601 --> 15:43.721
No.

15:43.721 --> 15:45.082
I have to make it myself.

15:46.761 --> 15:48.082
Doing it yourself?

15:48.402 --> 15:49.042
Sure.

15:51.601 --> 15:52.962
(Male Sweater)
This one looks simpler.

15:53.682 --> 15:54.682
I'll make this, then.

15:54.841 --> 15:55.402
Sure.

15:56.042 --> 15:56.481
By the way,

15:56.761 --> 15:57.881
what are

15:58.042 --> 16:00.442
your husband's measurements?

16:01.802 --> 16:04.082
His waist...

16:05.121 --> 16:07.241
It's about the same as Mr. Chen's.

16:08.001 --> 16:10.481
His shoulders are about
as wide as Mr. Xu's.

16:12.361 --> 16:14.841
You're not very close
with your husband, are you?

16:55.361 --> 16:56.241
Yang.

16:56.241 --> 16:58.202
You can work here for now.

16:59.322 --> 17:00.282
Thank you, Uncle Fu.

17:00.761 --> 17:01.481
Remember.

17:01.601 --> 17:02.962
Mr. Yuan's submissions

17:02.962 --> 17:04.362
are our top priority.

17:04.362 --> 17:05.761
Focus on that.

17:06.202 --> 17:07.402
I've gathered

17:07.402 --> 17:08.882
all the information you need.

17:09.162 --> 17:10.001
Tell me

17:10.642 --> 17:11.602
if you need anything.

17:15.281 --> 17:16.202
Don't worry, Uncle Fu.

17:16.561 --> 17:17.801
I'll complete my tasks.

17:18.602 --> 17:20.001
I won't let you and Mr. Yuan down.

17:20.721 --> 17:21.842
Okay, get to work.

17:27.572 --> 17:29.722
(Document Folder)

17:41.962 --> 17:43.860
Mr. Liao, here are
the documents you asked for.

17:46.922 --> 17:47.642
Fang Muyang.

17:48.481 --> 17:49.922
Have you finished training?

17:50.962 --> 17:51.321
Yes.

17:52.281 --> 17:54.962
So, you've been assigned to the press?

17:55.162 --> 17:56.001
Not exactly.

17:56.260 --> 17:58.241
I'm illustrating
for Mr. Yuan's work temporarily.

18:00.402 --> 18:02.402
I'm interning as a reporter.

18:02.682 --> 18:04.281
Come to me if you need anything.

18:05.402 --> 18:06.162
Thanks.

18:06.561 --> 18:07.642
But, I don't think

18:08.402 --> 18:09.481
our work is related.

18:33.561 --> 18:35.481
Keep a close eye on patient 17.

18:35.481 --> 18:36.882
Inform me immediately

18:36.882 --> 18:38.001
if he has a fever.

18:38.001 --> 18:38.801
Okay.

18:39.962 --> 18:40.962
Patient 26

18:40.962 --> 18:42.602
can be discharged tomorrow

18:42.602 --> 18:44.122
if everything's normal.

18:44.122 --> 18:44.922
Okay, Dr. Qu.

18:45.081 --> 18:45.642
Get to work.

18:59.460 --> 19:01.740
(To: Qu Hua
From: Fang Mujing)

19:22.235 --> 19:24.760
(It's getting cold.
Remember to bundle up.)

19:48.481 --> 19:49.281
Qu Hua.

19:50.801 --> 19:52.202
It's not even winter now.

19:52.480 --> 19:53.561
Why are you all bundled up?

19:54.962 --> 19:55.820
I have a slight cold.

19:56.122 --> 19:56.602
That's why.

19:57.962 --> 19:59.962
Need some cold medicine?

20:01.202 --> 20:01.922
No.

20:02.110 --> 20:02.962
It'll get better soon.

20:20.842 --> 20:22.882
Dumplings are ready!

20:23.202 --> 20:24.442
Come on.

20:25.321 --> 20:28.041
Today is an occasion
of double happiness.

20:28.162 --> 20:29.202
Now, we have

20:29.281 --> 20:30.882
two new family members.

20:31.041 --> 20:31.761
As the head

20:32.122 --> 20:33.761
of this family...

20:34.642 --> 20:36.481
I mean, occasionally.

20:37.882 --> 20:40.801
I'd like to welcome Fang

20:41.602 --> 20:42.642
and Lin Mei

20:42.642 --> 20:44.962
to our big, warm family.

20:44.962 --> 20:45.481
Come on.

20:46.481 --> 20:47.602
Thank you.

20:47.882 --> 20:48.442
Cheers.

20:52.241 --> 20:53.001
Take it easy.

20:53.001 --> 20:54.561
You don't want to pass out.

20:54.761 --> 20:55.481
I'm fine.

20:55.481 --> 20:56.521
I seldom drink

20:56.521 --> 20:57.882
because of you.

20:58.001 --> 20:59.442
Listen, Fang.

20:59.642 --> 21:01.362
When it comes to drinking,

21:01.362 --> 21:04.442
no one can beat me.

21:06.202 --> 21:06.682
Come on.

21:06.682 --> 21:07.281
As for me,

21:07.281 --> 21:08.362
I don't ask for much.

21:08.402 --> 21:10.041
I just hope that my children

21:10.081 --> 21:11.001
can enjoy

21:11.241 --> 21:12.402
a prosperous

21:12.402 --> 21:13.682
and peaceful new year.

21:13.682 --> 21:15.721
Better yet, you should have children.

21:17.122 --> 21:19.602
We can babysit for you

21:20.162 --> 21:21.761
while we're still healthy.

21:21.882 --> 21:23.442
Mom, don't worry.

21:23.842 --> 21:25.801
We'll do our best.

21:26.122 --> 21:26.801
Yeah.

21:26.801 --> 21:27.321
Nice!

21:28.642 --> 21:29.122
Yes.

21:29.481 --> 21:30.761
Do your best.

21:31.162 --> 21:31.962
Yeah.

21:32.241 --> 21:33.402
What about you?

21:33.402 --> 21:34.842
We will.

21:35.682 --> 21:36.801
Dig in.

21:36.801 --> 21:37.362
Let's try the dumplings.

21:37.362 --> 21:38.481
Cheers to you.

21:38.481 --> 21:39.561
Try the dumplings.

21:40.962 --> 21:42.122
They'll turn cold soon.

21:42.481 --> 21:43.041
Lin Mei.

21:46.842 --> 21:47.321
Wait.

21:47.842 --> 21:48.241
Here.

21:52.281 --> 21:53.721
Before we dig in,

21:54.081 --> 21:55.801
I have something to say.

21:56.882 --> 21:57.402
Mom.

21:58.041 --> 21:58.842
We're at home,

21:58.842 --> 21:59.481
not the factory.

21:59.481 --> 22:00.162
Now...

22:01.241 --> 22:02.442
Let her say.

22:03.561 --> 22:04.362
Fine.

22:06.402 --> 22:07.241
Ling Yi.

22:08.801 --> 22:09.882
You've been dating

22:10.402 --> 22:12.321
Ye Feng for quite some time.

22:13.321 --> 22:14.801
Your parents aren't around,

22:15.202 --> 22:16.122
so I'd like

22:17.041 --> 22:18.922
to make a suggestion.

22:20.122 --> 22:21.280
After the Chinese New Year,

22:21.561 --> 22:22.721
let's choose a good day

22:23.922 --> 22:24.721
for you two

22:25.321 --> 22:26.922
to get married.

22:29.081 --> 22:30.041
What do you think?

22:33.001 --> 22:33.602
Sure, Mom.

22:38.122 --> 22:39.321
Sure, Mom.

22:40.001 --> 22:40.602
Nice!

22:40.922 --> 22:42.202
That's settled, then.

22:42.842 --> 22:43.521
Let's dig in!

22:43.521 --> 22:44.001
Come on.

22:45.442 --> 22:46.597
Here.

22:46.922 --> 22:47.481
Ling Yi.

22:48.721 --> 22:49.721
Happy Chinese New Year.

22:49.730 --> 22:50.721
- What about me?
- Happy Chinese New Year.

22:50.721 --> 22:51.922
Happy Chinese New Year.

23:23.001 --> 23:23.842
Who's there?

23:24.642 --> 23:25.202
Me.

23:33.122 --> 23:34.281
What brings you here?

23:34.521 --> 23:36.882
It's Happy Chinese New Year,
a time of reunion.

23:37.170 --> 23:39.080
I thought you'd be celebrating
with Fang Muyang.

23:41.241 --> 23:43.001
I told him I'd be in Jiangnan.

23:46.001 --> 23:47.241
Wouldn't your parents be upset

23:47.682 --> 23:49.122
if you're not celebrating at home?

23:52.521 --> 23:54.281
I am celebrating at home.

24:12.321 --> 24:14.642
When are you planning to have kids?

24:15.882 --> 24:16.521
What?

24:17.202 --> 24:18.481
Drop that act.

24:18.521 --> 24:20.402
When are you planning to have kids?

24:20.521 --> 24:22.281
Since you're with him now,

24:22.481 --> 24:23.882
it'll come sooner or later.

24:24.241 --> 24:26.481
Do you remember what I told you
when you got married?

24:26.882 --> 24:27.922
Yeah, Mom.

24:27.922 --> 24:29.041
Got it.

24:30.481 --> 24:30.922
Fei Ting.

24:30.922 --> 24:32.162
I want to watch too.

24:33.642 --> 24:34.682
Be careful.

24:40.041 --> 24:40.761
Another shot.

24:44.882 --> 24:45.682
Take it easy, Dad.

24:47.241 --> 24:49.481
You're a good drinker too.

24:51.081 --> 24:52.602
I just don't blush easily.

24:52.820 --> 24:53.721
I'm not as good as you.

24:55.922 --> 24:56.721
Fang.

24:58.202 --> 24:59.202
My son.

25:01.202 --> 25:02.162
Now,

25:02.481 --> 25:03.642
there's only two of us here.

25:04.922 --> 25:06.442
As the saying goes,

25:06.721 --> 25:09.081
after wine comes the truth.

25:09.721 --> 25:10.561
So,

25:11.122 --> 25:12.122
let me ask you something.

25:13.281 --> 25:14.602
Can you guarantee

25:15.122 --> 25:16.402
that you'd be nice

25:16.842 --> 25:18.321
to my daughter in this life?

25:19.602 --> 25:20.202
Yes.

25:23.481 --> 25:24.202
Of course.

25:27.985 --> 25:32.522
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

25:33.321 --> 25:33.721
Dad.

25:34.980 --> 25:37.100
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

25:37.122 --> 25:37.922
I know

25:39.481 --> 25:41.321
you're worried that Fei Ni would suffer

25:42.642 --> 25:43.481
after marrying me.

25:44.481 --> 25:46.642
I can't provide her
with much material wants,

25:49.642 --> 25:50.481
but I can

25:52.122 --> 25:53.442
promise you and Mom something.

25:56.842 --> 25:58.081
I will always respect her,

25:59.842 --> 26:00.642
love her

26:02.442 --> 26:03.241
and support her.

26:03.322 --> 26:07.947
♪When summer comes, I think of you♪

26:08.001 --> 26:09.602
I won't let her regret choosing me.

26:10.247 --> 26:15.602
♪The fallen leaves in autumn,
you belong to me♪

26:15.602 --> 26:16.202
Come on.

26:17.721 --> 26:21.721
Let us drink our hearts out.

26:21.721 --> 26:25.882
Until we achieve our ambitions.

26:25.882 --> 26:29.202
We'll make it big in the future.

26:29.202 --> 26:33.397
♪There's a small place♪

26:33.997 --> 26:40.785
♪Where everyone has big dreams♪

26:41.260 --> 26:48.140
♪Every cute face♪

26:48.422 --> 26:54.860
♪Glows from the heart♪

26:55.397 --> 27:01.700
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

27:02.340 --> 27:08.940
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

27:08.940 --> 27:16.740
♪You belong to me, you see the light♪

27:16.740 --> 27:24.220
♪Remember, that's me thinking of you♪

27:53.682 --> 27:54.962
Didn't you bring more clothes?

27:55.801 --> 27:56.281
No.

27:57.081 --> 27:57.922
This is warm enough.

28:01.402 --> 28:02.281
Bundle up

28:02.281 --> 28:03.001
when we go out.

28:03.010 --> 28:03.721
It's cold outside.

28:04.241 --> 28:05.081
Where are we going?

28:05.960 --> 28:06.761
It's Chinese New Year.

28:06.761 --> 28:08.060
Of course we're visiting family.

28:21.442 --> 28:22.602
Have some tea.

28:25.321 --> 28:26.081
Mujing.

28:26.180 --> 28:27.842
I thought you're
celebrating in Jiangnan.

28:28.202 --> 28:29.041
What brings you here?

28:31.402 --> 28:32.041
I...

28:32.122 --> 28:33.321
That was our plan.

28:33.721 --> 28:34.922
But she was busy,

28:34.922 --> 28:36.001
so I came instead.

28:38.050 --> 28:39.081
How long will you be here?

28:41.281 --> 28:42.281
Four days.

28:44.041 --> 28:45.882
I switched shifts with my colleagues

28:46.321 --> 28:48.321
so I could spend more time
with your sister.

28:55.402 --> 28:58.162
Why don't you stay for lunch?

28:58.162 --> 28:59.362
- Sure.
- No need.

29:05.650 --> 29:06.321
How about this?

29:06.642 --> 29:07.602
I'll cook something.

29:08.041 --> 29:09.860
Your sister has never
tried my cooking too.

29:10.321 --> 29:11.321
You can cook?

29:15.801 --> 29:16.642
Where's the kitchen?

29:16.660 --> 29:17.481
I'll take you there.

29:17.970 --> 29:18.922
I'll be your assistant.

29:19.202 --> 29:19.842
Sure.

29:19.842 --> 29:20.721
We're cooking today.

29:20.721 --> 29:21.650
Just sit here and wait.

29:24.122 --> 29:24.682
Mujing.

29:25.321 --> 29:25.882
Enjoy.

29:34.202 --> 29:34.801
The factory

29:35.241 --> 29:36.481
called me over.

29:36.801 --> 29:37.642
I need to go.

29:37.842 --> 29:39.241
You can have lunch with Dad and Mom.

29:39.520 --> 29:40.281
Don't wait for me.

29:41.481 --> 29:42.602
You're going out again?

29:42.842 --> 29:44.922
You promised to visit my family today.

29:45.721 --> 29:47.081
I know. I'll be back.

29:47.320 --> 29:49.241
Don't worry, I'll be back
right after I'm done.

29:49.801 --> 29:50.321
Bye.

30:18.162 --> 30:19.081
Not bad, Qu Hua.

30:19.180 --> 30:21.540
Your knife skills are just as good
as your scalpel skills.

30:21.682 --> 30:22.521
Nice.

30:23.580 --> 30:24.922
I learned cooking when I was a student.

30:25.721 --> 30:27.561
I didn't expect it

30:27.642 --> 30:28.922
to be useful today.

30:31.122 --> 30:32.740
How are things between you
and my sister?

30:34.081 --> 30:34.922
Pretty good.

30:36.041 --> 30:36.521
Really?

30:39.442 --> 30:40.041
Yes.

30:44.842 --> 30:46.682
Some marriages are like candies.

30:47.041 --> 30:48.122
Sweet,

30:48.561 --> 30:50.642
but too much sugar
can be bad for health.

30:51.122 --> 30:53.521
Some marriages are like Chinese herbs.

30:54.041 --> 30:55.001
Bitter,

30:55.721 --> 30:57.721
but in the long term,

30:58.041 --> 30:59.081
it improves your health.

31:02.122 --> 31:03.801
You'd better check on me later.

31:04.081 --> 31:05.480
I've been having a lot of candies.

31:11.521 --> 31:13.922
Why don't you tell me
stories about your sister?

31:14.642 --> 31:15.922
I want to know her better.

31:16.442 --> 31:17.041
Sure.

31:18.370 --> 31:19.721
Don't tell her I told you, though.

31:22.682 --> 31:23.602
My sister

31:24.602 --> 31:25.481
has always been proud.

31:26.962 --> 31:28.241
She can be stubborn, too.

31:29.001 --> 31:31.081
There was this time

31:31.721 --> 31:33.041
when she scored

31:33.721 --> 31:34.682
99.5 marks in a test.

31:35.402 --> 31:36.721
When she reached home, she cried.

31:37.521 --> 31:38.721
I think she was

31:39.721 --> 31:41.241
utterly defeated by that 0.5 marks.

31:43.081 --> 31:44.321
I got 59 marks.

32:01.122 --> 32:02.442
Brother Fei Ting, you're here.

32:02.442 --> 32:03.001
Yeah.

32:09.241 --> 32:10.882
Brother Fei Ting, are you cold?

32:11.122 --> 32:11.842
Cold?

32:12.321 --> 32:12.801
No.

32:40.481 --> 32:41.922
My brother is having an affair?

32:42.602 --> 32:43.362
No way.

32:43.362 --> 32:45.001
Lin Mei, this must be
a misunderstanding.

32:45.402 --> 32:47.721
I saw him entering someone's house,

32:48.122 --> 32:50.202
and someone called him Brother Fei Ting.

32:50.842 --> 32:52.162
Besides, his shirt often

32:52.321 --> 32:53.721
reeks of snow cream.

32:54.122 --> 32:56.481
He kept lying that he has
work in the factory.

32:56.481 --> 32:58.122
What else could it be, if not an affair?

32:58.122 --> 32:59.081
Don't get worked up.

32:59.081 --> 33:00.321
My brother's not that kind of person.

33:00.321 --> 33:00.950
Let's go and see.

33:02.001 --> 33:02.602
Here.

33:04.721 --> 33:05.521
Wait.

33:06.922 --> 33:08.362
If your brother is having an affair,

33:08.962 --> 33:09.642
what should I...

33:09.642 --> 33:10.241
Don't worry.

33:10.602 --> 33:11.842
I'll be on your side.

33:14.882 --> 33:16.281
Someone's knocking.

33:16.290 --> 33:17.460
Brother Fei Ting, I'll get the door.

33:17.882 --> 33:18.442
See?

33:20.962 --> 33:21.940
Who are you looking for?

33:21.960 --> 33:22.842
Fei Ting is my brother,

33:22.842 --> 33:23.761
not yours.

33:24.642 --> 33:26.041
(Happiness)
Here comes the fish!

33:26.110 --> 33:27.947
(Happiness)

33:28.001 --> 33:29.521
Here comes the fish!

33:32.801 --> 33:33.761
Brother Fei Ting!

33:34.321 --> 33:35.402
Here are the potatoes!

33:36.362 --> 33:37.202
Hand them over.

33:38.761 --> 33:39.721
Serve the beef.

33:39.962 --> 33:40.521
Sure.

33:41.001 --> 33:41.801
Fei Ni?

33:41.801 --> 33:42.801
Hey, Fei Ting.

33:43.162 --> 33:44.041
Your sister's here.

33:44.481 --> 33:45.281
Quick!

33:45.561 --> 33:46.362
Coming!

33:48.202 --> 33:49.241
What brings you two here?

33:53.602 --> 33:54.081
Wait...

33:59.922 --> 34:01.001
What are you doing here?

34:02.442 --> 34:03.081
I...

34:03.761 --> 34:04.442
It's...

34:05.001 --> 34:06.940
It's Chinese New Year.
Lots of parties around,

34:06.962 --> 34:08.722
so I'm helping Mr. Li cooking.

34:09.362 --> 34:11.081
So, when you said you've got work,

34:12.161 --> 34:13.601
you've been cooking too?

34:15.041 --> 34:15.842
Yeah.

34:16.601 --> 34:17.681
It's getting cold lately,

34:17.922 --> 34:20.121
so I'm saving up to buy you a sweater.

34:20.442 --> 34:21.641
You've been wanting one, too.

34:23.442 --> 34:24.442
Why are you here, though?

34:29.641 --> 34:31.041
To visit you.

34:31.242 --> 34:33.681
Fang Muyang is waiting for me.
I'm going home.

34:34.922 --> 34:36.121
Stay safe.

34:43.601 --> 34:44.601
How did you know

34:44.802 --> 34:45.601
I'm here?

34:48.041 --> 34:49.601
What if the factory knows you're here?

34:50.322 --> 34:51.722
You might lose your job.

34:54.161 --> 34:54.681
No.

34:54.860 --> 34:55.842
They're a strict bunch,

34:55.842 --> 34:57.070
but as long as it doesn't
affect production,

34:57.081 --> 34:58.722
they'll just turn a blind eye.

34:59.242 --> 34:59.882
Besides,

35:00.242 --> 35:02.641
Mr. Li is paying me 3.50 yuan for this.

35:02.760 --> 35:03.350
Think about it.

35:03.360 --> 35:05.950
If I help out three times a month,
I get paid more than 10 yuan.

35:09.242 --> 35:11.842
Don't keep this from me again.

35:12.561 --> 35:13.842
You're bad

35:14.322 --> 35:15.402
at hiding secrets.

35:17.081 --> 35:17.681
Yeah.

35:19.001 --> 35:19.641
I know.

35:19.820 --> 35:20.402
Another thing.

35:21.170 --> 35:22.760
Make sure this doesn't affect your work.

35:24.561 --> 35:25.001
Let's go.

35:25.242 --> 35:26.161
To my parents' house.

35:26.442 --> 35:26.962
No.

35:26.962 --> 35:28.561
They're waiting for me inside.

35:28.760 --> 35:29.442
Brother Fei Ting.

35:29.442 --> 35:30.362
They're rushing.

35:30.442 --> 35:31.521
Call him Comrade Fei Ting!

35:31.842 --> 35:32.362
Yes.

35:33.001 --> 35:33.922
Comrade Fei Ting.

35:33.962 --> 35:34.722
They're rushing.

35:35.282 --> 35:35.842
Coming.

35:36.802 --> 35:37.950
You let her call you Brother?

35:38.322 --> 35:39.962
Be serious when you're working.

35:40.161 --> 35:40.681
Don't smile.

35:42.442 --> 35:43.041
Come back.

35:53.842 --> 35:54.442
Bye.

35:55.722 --> 35:56.481
Stay safe.

35:57.842 --> 35:58.442
Meat!

35:58.442 --> 35:59.762
Meat with celery!

35:59.762 --> 36:00.922
Look who's got an appetite.

36:00.922 --> 36:02.820
Of course we're having meat
in Chinese New Year.

36:02.922 --> 36:04.561
Ever since Aunt Mei moved out,

36:04.601 --> 36:06.922
we haven't had meat often.

36:07.521 --> 36:09.762
Before your aunt got married,

36:09.762 --> 36:11.962
she brought her meat and
textile coupons back home

36:11.962 --> 36:13.001
for our family to use.

36:13.402 --> 36:14.802
Now that she's married,

36:14.802 --> 36:17.201
she's giving those vouchers
to someone else's family.

36:17.481 --> 36:18.282
Hush.

36:19.242 --> 36:20.402
That's why they say

36:20.402 --> 36:23.001
a married daughter
is like water thrown outside the door.

36:23.001 --> 36:24.481
There's no use being nice to her.

36:24.802 --> 36:25.641
Eat up.

36:29.561 --> 36:30.962
But you know what else water is?

36:30.962 --> 36:32.641
Water symbolizes wealth.

36:32.650 --> 36:33.802
Darling, we've been getting richer

36:33.802 --> 36:35.561
ever since you married
into our family, see?

36:36.402 --> 36:37.842
- That's more like it.
- Have some meat, darling.

36:38.260 --> 36:39.161
No, it's for our son.

36:40.041 --> 36:40.882
Grandma.

36:40.947 --> 36:42.681
Why is there so little meat?

36:44.242 --> 36:45.322
You call this little?

36:45.561 --> 36:47.242
It's underneath the veggies.

36:47.242 --> 36:48.842
You can have it all, here.

36:48.842 --> 36:50.201
No one else can have meat today.

36:50.201 --> 36:51.161
It's all mine!

36:51.161 --> 36:53.161
We're family. It's for everyone.

36:53.161 --> 36:54.041
Mom, have some meat.

36:54.201 --> 36:54.802
Have more.

36:54.962 --> 36:55.601
Here you go.

36:55.601 --> 36:56.121
Thank you.

36:58.001 --> 36:58.842
Mom.

36:58.842 --> 36:59.842
Hey, everyone.

37:00.442 --> 37:01.442
You're here, Lin Mei.

37:01.442 --> 37:02.920
I'm here to wish you a happy new year.

37:04.041 --> 37:06.641
The cooperative gave us some
canned food before the holidays.

37:06.722 --> 37:07.722
I kept two for myself.

37:07.722 --> 37:08.641
The rest is for you.

37:08.641 --> 37:09.802
Great.

37:10.140 --> 37:11.081
You haven't had lunch?

37:11.242 --> 37:11.802
No.

37:11.922 --> 37:13.161
Perfect timing. Join us.

37:14.641 --> 37:15.322
Where's Dad?

37:15.521 --> 37:17.322
He's working overtime.

37:18.762 --> 37:19.802
Come here.

37:19.802 --> 37:21.121
Let your aunt sit here.

37:25.481 --> 37:26.470
Let me get you some rice.

37:26.481 --> 37:27.282
Thanks, Mom.

37:28.322 --> 37:29.882
Jianshe, have you been good?

37:30.201 --> 37:30.762
Yes.

37:30.962 --> 37:31.842
Jianshe.

37:32.161 --> 37:34.161
Your aunt picked a good time
to come back.

37:34.161 --> 37:35.962
She rarely comes back.

37:36.121 --> 37:37.402
Now that we're having meat today,

37:37.402 --> 37:38.242
she's back.

37:39.161 --> 37:40.802
Aunt, don't take my meat.

37:41.362 --> 37:42.601
I won't.

37:42.722 --> 37:44.081
You can have meat at my house.

37:45.242 --> 37:46.481
Your aunt

37:46.481 --> 37:48.001
and her husband are both working.

37:48.001 --> 37:49.922
She's probably got
unlimited meat coupons.

37:50.242 --> 37:51.161
Unlike us.

37:51.161 --> 37:52.260
We need to scrimp and save,

37:52.322 --> 37:54.322
and still entertain an uninvited guest.

37:55.842 --> 37:57.242
Aihong, don't say that.

37:57.242 --> 37:59.442
She's family, not an uninvited guest.

37:59.442 --> 38:01.161
It's not a big deal.

38:01.201 --> 38:02.442
Lin Mei, dig in.

38:02.842 --> 38:03.402
Here.

38:04.962 --> 38:05.362
Dig in.

38:05.561 --> 38:06.362
Eat up.

38:07.561 --> 38:08.442
Try the tofu.

38:16.362 --> 38:16.962
Lin Mei.

38:17.601 --> 38:19.161
Your nephew is a growing boy.

38:19.161 --> 38:20.121
Why take his food?

38:20.641 --> 38:21.601
I'm not.

38:21.610 --> 38:22.802
There's still plenty left.

38:22.802 --> 38:24.780
No, there's only like
100 grams of meat in here.

38:25.842 --> 38:28.001
In the past, I gave this family
all my meat coupons.

38:28.242 --> 38:29.922
That's worth a few kilograms of meat.

38:30.442 --> 38:31.842
Now that I'm married,

38:32.041 --> 38:34.001
I can't even eat at home in peace?

38:34.722 --> 38:35.242
What?

38:35.681 --> 38:36.802
Have I been feeding

38:37.001 --> 38:38.282
a bunch of ingrates all along?

38:38.842 --> 38:39.641
Lin Mei.

38:39.842 --> 38:41.322
You used to be part of the Lins.

38:41.322 --> 38:43.041
It's normal for you to give us
your meat coupons.

38:43.041 --> 38:44.201
Now that you've married into the Feis,

38:44.201 --> 38:45.740
you shouldn't even
come back here for lunch.

38:45.762 --> 38:47.001
Don't you know that?

38:48.001 --> 38:48.722
Exactly.

38:50.481 --> 38:51.481
Happy new year!

38:51.481 --> 38:51.922
Mom.

38:51.930 --> 38:52.802
- Fei Ting, you're here.
- Song.

38:52.802 --> 38:53.722
Aihong, Jianshe.

38:53.730 --> 38:54.402
Happy Chinese New Year.

38:54.802 --> 38:55.362
Lin Mei.

38:56.402 --> 38:57.081
I got these...

38:57.242 --> 38:59.402
You bought these
from the restaurant, right?

38:59.601 --> 39:00.481
Hand them over.

39:00.922 --> 39:01.820
Had you come any later,

39:01.882 --> 39:03.802
I'd have been kicked out by now.

39:05.081 --> 39:05.641
Look.

39:08.242 --> 39:08.802
Fei Ting.

39:08.842 --> 39:10.201
Sit down and join us.

39:10.201 --> 39:11.081
Dig in.

39:11.081 --> 39:11.842
Here.

39:11.842 --> 39:12.922
Come here, Jianshe.

39:12.922 --> 39:14.402
Let's have meat together.

39:15.282 --> 39:16.722
Let's have meat.

39:17.322 --> 39:18.561
Take whatever you want.

39:18.601 --> 39:19.681
What shall we have?

39:20.121 --> 39:20.722
Meat.

39:20.722 --> 39:21.242
Here.

39:22.561 --> 39:23.922
Give me that.

39:26.070 --> 39:26.882
You should eat, too.

39:26.882 --> 39:27.601
Aihong.

39:28.121 --> 39:29.641
I'm not freeloading.

39:29.802 --> 39:32.041
I asked Fei Ting
to buy some food from the restaurant.

39:32.362 --> 39:33.242
I wonder if the Lins

39:33.242 --> 39:34.842
can eat something

39:34.842 --> 39:36.161
brought over by the Feis.

39:37.121 --> 39:37.962
Aunt.

39:37.962 --> 39:39.180
I'm part of the Fei family now.

39:40.322 --> 39:41.762
How are you part of the Fei family?

39:41.922 --> 39:43.362
My aunt is,

39:43.442 --> 39:45.242
so I am too.

39:47.402 --> 39:48.242
Dad, Mom.

39:48.242 --> 39:49.561
Call me Fei Jianshe from now on.

39:50.081 --> 39:50.882
I...

39:50.882 --> 39:52.161
You glutton.

39:52.161 --> 39:53.081
Eat up.

39:53.081 --> 39:53.922
Have more meat.

39:53.962 --> 39:54.641
So much meat.

39:54.641 --> 39:55.402
Enjoy.

39:55.601 --> 39:56.641
Have some fish.

39:56.842 --> 39:57.242
Here.

39:57.242 --> 39:57.722
Fish and meat.

39:57.722 --> 39:58.760
I'll pick the bones out.

39:58.802 --> 39:59.402
Eat this.

40:00.322 --> 40:01.121
Here, Fei Ting.

40:01.201 --> 40:01.842
Have some meat.

40:01.842 --> 40:02.362
Thank you.

40:15.260 --> 40:16.450
What happened to your blanket?

40:20.362 --> 40:21.442
I spilled some water

40:21.442 --> 40:22.442
on the blanket,

40:22.802 --> 40:23.922
so it's wet.

40:26.041 --> 40:27.760
How are you going to keep yourself
warm tonight?

40:32.722 --> 40:33.481
It's okay.

40:33.962 --> 40:35.161
Go to sleep.

40:35.161 --> 40:36.802
It's not going to dry tonight.

40:39.402 --> 40:39.882
Well...

40:41.121 --> 40:41.722
Okay.

40:42.041 --> 40:42.842
Sleep tight.

41:28.402 --> 41:29.722
Are you okay?

41:30.001 --> 41:31.041
I'm fine.

41:31.521 --> 41:33.001
Go to sleep. I'm not cold.

41:40.282 --> 41:40.962
That's enough.

41:41.041 --> 41:42.402
You can share my blanket.

41:42.640 --> 41:43.842
You don't want to catch a cold.

41:44.362 --> 41:44.802
Here.

41:47.442 --> 41:48.402
Thanks.

41:50.362 --> 41:51.242
Go to sleep.

42:17.001 --> 42:18.242
Fang Muyang, what are you doing?

42:19.242 --> 42:19.842
What are you...

42:20.601 --> 42:21.802
You're so annoying!

42:22.001 --> 42:23.242
You're pulling my hair!

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
